; modern-poalim-scraper dev-script environment reference. Copy to
; `packages/modern-poalim-scraper/.env`.
;
; Read only by the manual dev scripts in `src/test/` (e.g. `yarn test:hapoalim`), which run one
; scraper against the real bank site with your own credentials. They load this package's `.env`,
; then the root `.env`. The library itself reads no environment variables: scraper-app passes
; credentials from its vault. Set only the sources you want to try; each script checks its own pair
; and exits if it is missing.
;
; All values are real bank credentials. [secret] Never commit them.

; Bank Hapoalim (`yarn test:hapoalim`, src/test/scrape-poalim.ts).
# USER_CODE=
# PASSWORD=

; Isracard (`yarn test:isracard`). ID number, password and the card's first 6 digits.
# ISRACARD_ID=
# ISRACARD_PASSWORD=
# ISRACARD_6_DIGITS=

; Cal (`node dist/test/scrape-cal.js` after `yarn build`). The last 4 digits of one card.
# CAL_USERNAME=
# CAL_PASSWORD=
# CAL_LAST4DIGITS=

; Discount Bank (`node dist/test/scrape-discount.js` after `yarn build`).
# DISCOUNT_ID=
# DISCOUNT_PASSWORD=

; Max (`yarn test:max`).
# MAX_USERNAME=
# MAX_PASSWORD=

; Otsar Hahayal (`yarn test:otsar-hahayal`).
# OTSAR_HAHAYAL_USERNAME=
# OTSAR_HAHAYAL_PASSWORD=
